# {{project_name}}

An [Autumn](https://crates.io/crates/autumn-web) web application.

## Quickstart

Run these steps top-to-bottom on a clean checkout to get a route serving.

### 1. Prerequisites

- **Rust {{rust_version}}+** (edition 2024) — https://rustup.rs
- **The `autumn` CLI:**
  ```sh
  cargo install autumn-cli --version {{autumn_version}}
  ```
- **The Tailwind binary** (downloaded by `autumn setup`):
  ```sh
  autumn setup
  ```
- **A reachable Postgres** for database features. Don't have one? Generate a
  containerized database (and the rest of the deployment assets) with:
  ```sh
  autumn release init --target docker-compose
  ```
- **Diesel CLI** for the database path:
  ```sh
  cargo install diesel_cli --no-default-features --features postgres
  ```
- **The PostgreSQL client library (`libpq`).** The default scaffold keeps the
  `db` feature, so the base app links `libpq` at build time — it must be
  installed for `cargo build` / `autumn dev` to succeed, even before you have a
  running database configured. Install it with your package manager (e.g.
  `libpq-dev` on Debian/Ubuntu, `libpq` via Homebrew on macOS).

### 2. Apply migrations

```sh
autumn migrate
```

Applies any pending database migrations. (With no `[database]` configured this
is a no-op, so it's safe to run on the base app.)

### 3. Run the dev server

```sh
autumn dev
```

Then visit **http://localhost:3000** — you should get a `200` with
"Welcome to {{project_name}}!". Health endpoints are auto-mounted at
`/health` and `/actuator/health`.

## CLI reference

The most useful `autumn` verbs for day-to-day work:

| Command | What it does |
|---|---|
| `autumn dev` | Run the dev server with file watching + live reload. |
| `autumn migrate` | Apply pending database migrations. |
| `autumn doctor` | Preflight your environment / diagnose setup problems. |
| `autumn routes` | List all mounted routes. |
| `autumn generate scaffold <Name> field:Type …` | Scaffold a CRUD resource — model, migration, routes, and views. |
| `autumn release init --target docker-compose` | Generate deployment assets (e.g. a docker-compose with Postgres). |

## Project layout

| Path | Purpose |
|---|---|
| `autumn.toml` | Base config (server, database, session, security, logging). |
| `src/main.rs` | AppBuilder setup — register routes, tasks, jobs, migrations here. |
| `migrations/` | Diesel migrations — one directory per migration. |
| `static/` | Static assets served under `/static/`. |
